{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_title", "source_sha256": "391a94ed597f31472f78982298989143a30a177fbc894f278ffe374343c1333a", "ja": "真とおでかけ2", "zh": "和真外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "17aa7f3c4adf97ef9d601362ff54adf1f04fa96c2514c53f72383c026199fdfe", "ja": "真とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和真一起出门时的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad111b54fe961870937329179c3d0ab71c310a8d2345cdefac23bfe53ad1d4f8", "ja": "（せっかく岩手県に来たということで、真と中尊寺に\n来た。光り輝く金色堂に圧倒されてしまったな……）", "zh": "（难得来到了岩手县，就和真一起去了中尊寺。被那座闪耀着光芒的金色堂深深震撼了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "3a3d84f96d515b054a7e380ec89ed540b88197e1ec90e5c206987945cc01abc2", "ja": "金色堂、すごかったです……荘厳で、極楽、って\n感じがして！　すごいとしか言いようがないです！", "zh": "金色堂太壮观了……庄严肃穆的，感觉就像极乐世界一样！除了说太厉害了，我都不知道该怎么形容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7ceb71562668c3c371fdedc4649e9aeffa7167b11d9d5ed28dbb6af9d7541cb2", "ja": "{$P$}。たしかあの中に、\n藤原氏のミイラが納められているんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}。我记得藤原氏的木乃伊，就供奉在里面，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b14c4fe7783b1a7c72658515a87171274c8a9dbcd6ae1d5070aedcd7048fcd13", "ja": "ああ。ずいぶん昔に、その中の藤原泰衡の首桶から\n蓮の種が見つかったんだが……。", "zh": "啊。很久以前，在那里面的藤原泰衡首桶中发现了莲花种子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b932dc9780f72e5b76bed51154e572d363b51e95a883a8aac948749890f79f5", "ja": "その800年前の種が開花に成功して、\n公園で咲いてるそうだよ。", "zh": "那颗800年前的种子成功开花了，听说现在正在公园里盛开呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f899e75d73c1edc9bcab3e117bfda6932897df0a6e877de4cb2939c33b313b5", "ja": "そうなんですか！？　800年も前の種が、\n花を咲かせるなんて。ロマンチックな話ですね……！", "zh": "原来是这样！？没想到800年前的种子竟然开花了。真是浪漫啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "5d255b322976cfc5a90c599b104146a347f30db5a4f71468dd8ffd5542ceab34", "ja": "{$P$}。\nその蓮の花、今から見に行けませんか！？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n那朵莲花，现在要不要去看看！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a4fe2a0343f05b3e19ad2c85bb15aaf182e5f75fef53b7e322d0e677b18b9bd8", "ja": "季節外れだから、流石に今は無理かな……。\nまた機会があったらにしよう。", "zh": "不是花期，现在去肯定看不了吧……\n等下次有机会再去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_006mak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_006mak02_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "ee0dfc6a8824b71ca1335230070477b2ad9fdaf0fb7cfbec384555d0463d4c65", "ja": "そっか、残念……。でも、いつか絶対\n見に行きましょうね、{$P$}！", "zh": "这样啊，真遗憾……不过，我们以后一定要一起去看哦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
